      "Write: location 625 333; Sam, male, 16; ankle injury, cannot walk, cold; party of four; your phone number. {{mrew}}",
      "Dial 999, say 'Police', then 'Mountain Rescue'. Give the card. Stay put, keep the casualty warm, and wait for contact. {{mrew}}"
