     "t": "p",
     "x": "The traditional B2B buying process in this textbook has eight numbered stages: recognise the need, define it, develop specifications, search for suppliers, request proposals, evaluate proposals, decide, and evaluate after purchase. {{ps-buying2}} (Its key-takeaways box says seven steps but names eight, so we follow the numbered list.)"
