     "t": "p",
     "x": "We read chapter I of his 1918 book The Romance of Commerce, on honesty and advertising, and chapter XXIV, on the managers of a department store. It is his own book, so the claims about his methods are his. {{selfridge-roc}} The facts about the store come from Wikipedia. {{selfridge}} {{selfridges}}"
