     "t": "p",
     "x": "Research, in the textbook's definition, is scholarly investigation to discover, revise or report facts, theories and applications. {{sus-res1}} Primary research is reported by the person who did it, such as your own surveys and interviews. Secondary research is reported by someone else, which is most of what you will use. {{sus-res1}}"
