     "x": "Support, meanwhile, should be tested on four criteria: accuracy, authority, currency and objectivity. {{sus-sup1}} For accuracy, ask whether it contradicts other evidence, whether a statistic's origin is explained, and whether the logic makes sense. {{sus-sup1}} For authority, ask about training, publications, membership of a profession and experience. {{sus-sup1}} For currency, the text suggests under five years old as a general guideline, shorter for fast-moving fields. {{sus-sup1}} For objectivity, ask whether the source has financial or political interests, or hides its author. {{sus-sup1}}"
